  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Credit and Financial Services: Project to Support Agricultural and Rural Financial Inclusion in Burundi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of PAIFAR-B is to contribute to the sustainable reduction of poverty in Burundi.
The PAIFAR-B development objective is to enhance financial inclusion in agricultural and non-agricultural rural populations (producers, producer organizations and the most vulnerable groups, including women, young people and microentrepreneurs) by bridging the gap between the demand and supply of financial and non-financial services.</narrative>
  </description>
